WEBVTT

00:08.880 --> 00:11.670
<b>Honestly, I find that idea pretty hard to swallow...</b>

00:11.830 --> 00:13.580
<b>Yeah, I figured.</b>

00:14.170 --> 00:17.210
<b>But keep it somewhere in the back
of your mind for me, okay?</b>

00:17.670 --> 00:18.580
<b>All right.</b>

00:19.790 --> 00:23.380
<b>I saw a bunch of different things happening
across a twilight-colored plain...</b>

00:23.880 --> 00:25.420
<b>There was an Elf and a Prum!</b>

00:25.630 --> 00:27.330
<b>Then a boar and a chariot!</b>

00:29.080 --> 00:30.960
<b>But the wind will blow in our favor!</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:36.580
<b>The wind, huh...?</b>

00:38.880 --> 00:40.540
<b>You must win, Ottarl.</b>

00:40.750 --> 00:41.330
<b>Yes ma'am.</b>

00:41.920 --> 00:43.880
<b>Bell is going to be mine.</b>

00:44.500 --> 00:46.880
<b>This is the only way left to claim him.</b>

00:47.920 --> 00:50.330
<b>I am wholly devoted to Her Ladyship.</b>

00:51.630 --> 00:54.170
<b>So you better heed my every beck and call!</b>

00:54.750 --> 00:55.880
<b>To war, comrades!</b>

01:09.580 --> 01:11.960
<b>Come. Show me why you're her favorite.</b>

01:13.330 --> 01:15.080
<b>Without further ado...</b>

01:15.290 --> 01:19.330
<b>let the War Game begin!</b>

01:26.210 --> 01:31.250
<b>The story of today, sometimes the world is irony</b>

01:31.500 --> 01:35.380
<b>"Nevertheless..." In my heart</b>

01:35.380 --> 01:40.960
<b>I found this feeling and now it's our world</b>

01:50.420 --> 01:55.880
<b>I've been here since that day, continually seeking and searching</b>

01:56.130 --> 02:02.670
<b>Whenever I encounter weaknesses,
I have to overcome them one after another</b>

02:02.670 --> 02:06.670
<b>Fighting back tears each time</b>

02:06.920 --> 02:11.710
<b>Then getting back up for tomorrow
and the day after, that's how I've lived</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:17.000
<b>Having faith in the past and advancing beyond it</b>

02:17.170 --> 02:21.960
<b>Where something irreplaceable is waiting for us</b>

02:22.170 --> 02:26.670
<b>The story of adventure, it can begin today</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:32.750
<b>To prevent anyone from glorifying the tragic elegy</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:37.630
<b>Ah, I want to become strong, our counterattack begins</b>

02:37.750 --> 02:41.170
<b>It's okay to be uncool</b>

02:41.540 --> 02:47.250
<b>Ah, encounters are love, so that's where you've been, huh?</b>

02:56.080 --> 02:59.830
<b>Fólkvangr</b>

02:56.080 --> 02:59.830
<b>Hell</b>

02:56.880 --> 02:59.130
<b>Right now, in the Olza City ruins,</b>

02:59.130 --> 03:02.500
<b>the War Game between the Freya Familia
and the allied army is underway.</b>

03:02.500 --> 03:04.830
<b>It's a showdown of Hide-and-Seek.</b>

03:05.250 --> 03:09.000
<b>All participating Gods are wearing
a flower somewhere on them</b>

03:09.000 --> 03:11.210
<b>and if that gets stolen, they're out.</b>

03:11.210 --> 03:13.250
<b>Once all the Gods on either side are out, it's game over.</b>

03:13.250 --> 03:19.040
<b>Which means the Freya Familia will lose
the instant that Goddess Freya loses her flower.</b>

03:19.460 --> 03:23.830
<b>However, the adventurers of the Freya Familia have
earned a fearsome reputation as the "Einherjar"</b>

03:23.830 --> 03:25.460
<b>and they won't lose easily!</b>

03:25.960 --> 03:29.420
<b>The allies have superior numbers,
but what is their strategy?</b>

03:37.130 --> 03:39.500
<b>No sign of the enemy on the southeast side, Lady Lili!</b>

03:39.670 --> 03:42.750
<b>Hey, Prum. The center of the island
is deserted. What now?</b>

03:43.380 --> 03:46.000
<b>Lil' Squeak! There's nobody on the north periphery!</b>

03:46.250 --> 03:47.880
<b>We're infiltrating their territory now!</b>

03:47.880 --> 03:49.380
<b>C'mon! Tell me what to do!</b>

03:50.790 --> 03:53.130
<b>Are you okay, Miss Lili?</b>

03:54.420 --> 03:57.630
<b>My brain is getting totally overloaded!</b>

03:58.250 --> 04:01.040
<b>Make it happen. You have what it takes.</b>

04:03.130 --> 04:06.040
<b>I gotta suck it up. I'm in command now!</b>

04:06.880 --> 04:09.130
<b>Listen up! Here's the plan!</b>

04:10.630 --> 04:15.630
<b>I know I'm repeating myself, but the top priority for
all scouts is to locate Lady Freya and her forces.</b>

04:16.330 --> 04:18.420
<b>Gathering intel takes precedence over everything.</b>

04:19.630 --> 04:21.630
<b>I made 70% of our army serve as scouts.</b>

04:21.630 --> 04:24.380
<b>It's horribly unbalanced, but we don't have a choice.</b>

04:24.790 --> 04:27.580
<b>Fending off the Freya Familia's
assault would be impossible.</b>

04:27.960 --> 04:31.000
<b>Which means adopting a defensive position
will only seal our fate.</b>

04:31.630 --> 04:34.670
<b>That's why I chose to give up on defense and
focus on targeting their Goddess instead.</b>

04:35.210 --> 04:37.250
<b>So information is more important
than anything right now.</b>

04:37.790 --> 04:40.500
<b>What is the enemy doing?
How many are there? And where?</b>

04:40.960 --> 04:43.500
<b>Our goal is to find Lady Freya as soon as possible,</b>

04:43.750 --> 04:45.790
<b>and take her out at any cost before they can beat us.</b>

04:46.380 --> 04:48.170
<b>That's the only way we win this.</b>

04:49.170 --> 04:53.130
<b>Of course, it comes with a big risk
of our scouts being spotted and defeated.</b>

04:53.500 --> 04:54.460
<b>But right now...</b>

04:55.290 --> 04:56.920
<b>No signs of them heading our way.</b>

04:56.920 --> 04:58.170
<b>All quiet here, too.</b>

04:58.790 --> 05:00.000
<b>I'm pressing on.</b>

05:00.500 --> 05:02.540
<b>We've gone far enough to have crossed paths by now.</b>

05:03.170 --> 05:06.880
<b>This is weird. How come
we still don't know where they are?</b>

05:07.830 --> 05:09.040
<b>Uh, Liliruca Arde?</b>

05:10.040 --> 05:12.750
<b>My squad has already made it
halfway through their territory.</b>

05:16.040 --> 05:18.330
<b>Stay alert and keep forging ahead.</b>

05:19.130 --> 05:21.920
<b>Is luring us this far in part of their strategy?</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:25.960
<b>Do they want us to overextend our forces until
they're too far away from Hestia and the other Gods?</b>

05:27.210 --> 05:28.130
<b>I'm not sure.</b>

05:29.580 --> 05:32.330
<b>W-we've found them! Enemy forces spotted!</b>

05:33.380 --> 05:34.130
<b>Where?!</b>

05:34.460 --> 05:36.540
<b>The west side. At the edge of the island.</b>

05:36.880 --> 05:38.960
<b>All the way over there?! How many?</b>

05:39.250 --> 05:40.040
<b>I need numbers!</b>

05:41.830 --> 05:42.710
<b>Master Luvis?</b>

05:43.250 --> 05:44.420
<b>It's all of them...</b>

05:44.960 --> 05:45.670
<b>Huh?!</b>

05:46.750 --> 05:48.830
<b>The entire Freya Familia is here!</b>

05:49.420 --> 05:50.960
<b>They're all in one place?</b>

05:51.330 --> 05:52.500
<b>Are you kidding me?!</b>

05:52.750 --> 05:55.330
<b>Oh, hell. What are they up to?</b>

05:55.580 --> 05:58.790
<b>What about Lady Freya?
Do you actually see her anywhere?</b>

05:58.790 --> 05:59.960
<b>Maybe it's a trap!</b>

06:00.170 --> 06:01.580
<b>No. She's here.</b>

06:02.580 --> 06:04.960
<b>Goddess Freya is sitting inside the shrine.</b>

06:05.750 --> 06:07.500
<b>I can see them on my end, too.</b>

06:08.000 --> 06:10.880
<b>Vana Freya. Bringar.</b>

06:12.000 --> 06:15.210
<b>Dainsleif. Hildrsleif.</b>

06:15.790 --> 06:17.420
<b>And Ottarl.</b>

06:17.750 --> 06:19.710
<b>All of their big guns are here.</b>

06:23.250 --> 06:25.500
<b>That figures. It's a sound strategy.</b>

06:27.920 --> 06:30.170
<b>Master Hermes... is this okay?</b>

06:30.500 --> 06:32.380
<b>They haven't broken any rules.</b>

06:32.710 --> 06:34.630
<b>They simply threw all norms out the window.</b>

06:35.210 --> 06:40.330
<b>The Hide-and-Seek format was supposed to level
the playing field, but they just made it an all-out war.</b>

06:40.750 --> 06:43.790
<b>And that strategy only works
because they hold all the power.</b>

06:44.540 --> 06:49.040
<b>We shall keep our warriors within reach of my voice,
so I may conduct them like a choir.</b>

06:49.710 --> 06:51.920
<b>It is the most powerful formation available to us.</b>

06:52.830 --> 06:54.330
<b>I expect a swift response.</b>

06:54.630 --> 06:57.580
<b>There are only two options left
for you to choose from now.</b>

06:58.210 --> 07:00.130
<b>That Elf is downright diabolical!</b>

07:00.500 --> 07:03.000
<b>The only thing we can do now is make a suicide attack.</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:05.420
<b>Hey! What's the plan, chief?</b>

07:05.420 --> 07:06.960
<b>Gimme some orders here already!</b>

07:07.330 --> 07:12.210
<b>Dammit. Do we really stand any chance
at fighting the entire Freya Familia head on?</b>

07:13.330 --> 07:14.130
<b>Lili.</b>

07:18.710 --> 07:19.630
<b>Let's do it.</b>

07:22.250 --> 07:23.630
<b>I'm restructuring our forces!</b>

07:24.000 --> 07:25.830
<b>Master Luvis now leads a hit-and-run squadron.</b>

07:25.830 --> 07:27.580
<b>Everyone else will be split into three platoons.</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:29.250
<b>Lady Tsubaki leads a charge down the middle.</b>

07:29.250 --> 07:30.580
<b>Lady Aisha on the left flank.</b>

07:30.920 --> 07:33.380
<b>Lady Daphne and Master Bors
take command on the right flank.</b>

07:34.710 --> 07:37.040
<b>I'm moving to where I can keep
better track of the situation.</b>

07:37.330 --> 07:39.960
<b>Lady Chigusa, you should join up with Master Ouka.</b>

07:40.130 --> 07:40.750
<b>Okay!</b>

07:42.170 --> 07:43.250
<b>Challenge accepted!</b>

07:44.210 --> 07:46.210
<b>I commend you, Prum.</b>

07:46.670 --> 07:49.210
<b>You've made the right call,
so that we can engage you as planned.</b>

07:49.830 --> 07:51.750
<b>Equip everyone for a blitzkrieg.</b>

07:52.130 --> 07:54.580
<b>We won't bother with defense. Only offense!</b>

07:54.580 --> 07:55.210
<b>Yessir!</b>

07:57.790 --> 07:59.750
<b>It's so quiet...</b>

08:00.080 --> 08:03.500
<b>They're deliberately waiting for
our forces to switch formations.</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:05.790
<b>This is just the calm before the storm.</b>

08:06.290 --> 08:08.790
<b>Do you think we should move, too?</b>

08:09.130 --> 08:09.960
<b>There's no point.</b>

08:10.330 --> 08:13.670
<b>All we can do is watch and wait with bated breath.</b>

08:14.670 --> 08:16.500
<b>Okay. It's time.</b>

08:17.960 --> 08:20.710
<b>Right flank, left flank, and center platoons.</b>

08:21.080 --> 08:24.290
<b>Be wary of the enemy's response as
you advance into magic sword range.</b>

08:27.170 --> 08:29.380
<b>Full steam ahead. Don't stop.</b>

08:32.630 --> 08:33.580
<b>Keep going!</b>

08:37.170 --> 08:38.080
<b>Keep going!</b>

08:39.580 --> 08:40.250
<b>Now.</b>

08:43.080 --> 08:43.960
<b>H-here they come!</b>

08:43.960 --> 08:46.250
<b>The bastards got impatient and started charging at us!</b>

08:47.170 --> 08:48.420
<b>Ready your magic swords!</b>

08:49.920 --> 08:51.130
<b>Attack!</b>

08:51.290 --> 08:53.080
<b>KAZUKI!</b>

09:09.210 --> 09:10.790
<b>Stand strong! Attack again!</b>

09:12.460 --> 09:16.580
<b>Knock 'em flat! And don't stop
attacking until they STAY down!</b>

09:27.210 --> 09:28.880
<b>Get wrecked, ya asswipes!</b>

09:28.880 --> 09:32.000
<b>Nobody messes with the power of Crozzo magic swords!</b>

09:35.670 --> 09:37.170
<b>"My name is gold."</b>

09:37.710 --> 09:39.880
<b>"Aide of the Goddess sworn to an oath everlasting."</b>

09:40.330 --> 09:41.920
<b>"Scorched threefold."</b>

09:42.290 --> 09:45.750
<b>"Impaled for an eternity in the Pyrospear prison."</b>

09:46.130 --> 09:48.960
<b>"Thus a splendor is born that slays death itself."</b>

09:49.250 --> 09:50.710
<b>The Andhrímnir?!</b>

09:51.210 --> 09:52.880
<b>"Exult. Exult. Exult."</b>

09:53.540 --> 09:54.880
<b>"My name is gold."</b>

09:54.880 --> 09:58.750
<b>"Here there be perpetual strife,
under the light of resurrection."</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:00.500
<b>Zeo Gullveig.</b>

10:06.000 --> 10:09.330
<b>I embrace you all, courageous barbarians.</b>

10:09.580 --> 10:12.000
<b>May you be graced with the blessings of war.</b>

10:12.460 --> 10:14.960
<b>Go forth, Einherjar!</b>

10:15.710 --> 10:16.710
<b>Use the magic swords!</b>

10:16.710 --> 10:17.460
<b>Too late.</b>

10:19.460 --> 10:20.790
<b>Attack!</b>

10:23.460 --> 10:24.670
<b>We lost our chance!</b>

10:24.670 --> 10:26.880
<b>Lady Haruhime! Use level boost now!</b>

10:36.080 --> 10:37.630
<b>Back off, shitheads!</b>

10:44.250 --> 10:45.630
<b>We can't hold them all!</b>

10:45.630 --> 10:47.420
<b>Spellcasters, join in the fray!</b>

10:47.880 --> 10:49.920
<b>Focus the brunt of your attacks down the center!</b>

10:50.540 --> 10:52.500
<b>They made us waste our magic swords!</b>

10:52.750 --> 10:55.750
<b>But on the plus side,
we know where the Andhrímnir is now!</b>

10:56.040 --> 10:58.170
<b>Master Mord, do your thing!</b>

10:59.960 --> 11:02.420
<b>We've been waiting for you suckers to show up!</b>

11:02.880 --> 11:04.000
<b>Now eat this!</b>

11:06.290 --> 11:11.920
<b>Your recovery spells can't do jack shit if you're
too busy being attacked to even cast them!</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:14.130
<b>Get burned to a crisp!</b>

11:14.290 --> 11:16.580
<b>H-hey! That's overkill!</b>

11:16.580 --> 11:19.880
<b>There's no such thing as overkill when
it comes to fighting the Freya Familia!</b>

11:19.880 --> 11:23.000
<b>We gotta do our best to save Bell Cranel!</b>

11:23.500 --> 11:27.580
<b>This is hardly a surprise.
We're always the prime targets for an ambush.</b>

11:28.170 --> 11:30.210
<b>But do you think we care?</b>

11:31.380 --> 11:33.000
<b>Aesir Gullveig.</b>

11:33.380 --> 11:36.500
<b>My recovery spell is already active.</b>

11:40.420 --> 11:41.710
<b>Auto-heal?!</b>

11:41.710 --> 11:43.420
<b>No freakin' way!</b>

11:43.880 --> 11:44.880
<b>Damn you!</b>

11:44.880 --> 11:45.500
<b>Stop, Mord!</b>

11:45.710 --> 11:47.080
<b>You're going down, freak!</b>

11:47.880 --> 11:48.750
<b>So ugly.</b>

11:52.580 --> 11:54.000
<b>So disgusting.</b>

11:54.210 --> 11:57.000
<b>It sickens me. I can't stand the sight of you.</b>

11:57.380 --> 12:02.130
<b>How dare you dirtbags try and drag
our Goddess down to wallow in your damn filth!</b>

12:02.750 --> 12:04.380
<b>Go to hell, swine!</b>

12:09.500 --> 12:13.420
<b>The vulgar glare in your eyes,
your stench and slobber...</b>

12:13.830 --> 12:16.920
<b>I'm not letting you bring it anywhere near our Goddess!</b>

12:20.460 --> 12:23.290
<b>That takes care of their magic swords. Time to end this.</b>

12:23.540 --> 12:25.000
<b>Caelus Hildr!</b>

12:34.290 --> 12:35.670
<b>Hildrsleif!</b>

12:35.920 --> 12:37.290
<b>It's absurd how strong he is!</b>

12:40.380 --> 12:41.130
<b>Guys!</b>

12:52.880 --> 12:56.880
<b>Don't back down! If teams of three aren't enough,
then attack in teams of ten!</b>

12:57.460 --> 13:00.080
<b>This isn't looking good at all.</b>

13:00.330 --> 13:03.380
<b>We have to attack the Andhrímnir ready to risk everyth-</b>

13:02.330 --> 13:04.210
<b>Here comes trouble!</b>

13:04.210 --> 13:05.330
<b>It's a first-class adventurer!</b>

13:06.210 --> 13:07.080
<b>Hogni?!</b>

13:09.000 --> 13:12.080
<b>Argh! People I don't know are staring at me!</b>

13:13.330 --> 13:15.880
<b>C-crap, I gotta pull it together.</b>

13:18.330 --> 13:23.330
<b>Coming into contact with my enigmatic depth
is proof of your ill-fate. Now d-die!</b>

13:23.790 --> 13:25.040
<b>What's up with this guy?</b>

13:25.040 --> 13:27.210
<b>You can tell by the way he talks that he's a total loon...</b>

13:27.210 --> 13:28.380
<b>He gives me the creeps.</b>

13:28.380 --> 13:31.040
<b>P-please don't look at me like that!</b>

13:31.880 --> 13:35.500
<b>Oh no! I just remembered this
is being broadcast to all of Orario, isn't it?</b>

13:35.630 --> 13:39.500
<b>Ugh, screw this! I'm just gonna use it!</b>

13:39.920 --> 13:42.330
<b>"Be unsheathed, king of cursed blades."</b>

13:44.290 --> 13:45.500
<b>Stop his incantation!</b>

13:44.290 --> 13:47.130
<b>"With rationality as remuneration and fresh blood as tribute."</b>

13:45.500 --> 13:46.040
<b>Huh?</b>

13:46.040 --> 13:47.130
<b>Is it bad news?</b>

13:47.580 --> 13:51.130
<b>"From now until the banquet ends, wreak carnage."</b>

13:53.920 --> 13:55.080
<b>Dainsleif!</b>

13:57.290 --> 14:00.080
<b>Rebellious scum who defy
the divine will of our Goddess...</b>

14:00.290 --> 14:01.750
<b>I shall hear your penitence.</b>

14:02.420 --> 14:04.710
<b>But you shall give me your lifeblood in return.</b>

14:05.080 --> 14:06.880
<b>A spell that alters his personality!</b>

14:07.580 --> 14:10.380
<b>Lil' Squeak! Hook me up with a level boost!</b>

14:10.380 --> 14:11.420
<b>Okay!</b>

14:11.790 --> 14:16.000
<b>All you vermin who impede the Goddess
from her love do not deserve to live.</b>

14:16.250 --> 14:18.580
<b>Die! Worthless plebeians!</b>

14:21.790 --> 14:23.000
<b>Cyclops...</b>

14:23.630 --> 14:25.290
<b>You little accursed freak!</b>

14:25.290 --> 14:27.130
<b>I'm gonna snap you and your sword in two!</b>

14:29.750 --> 14:31.330
<b>The Fates never yield.</b>

14:31.630 --> 14:34.250
<b>I shall use this sword to carve out your gravestone!</b>

14:37.750 --> 14:39.040
<b>There's Dainsleif!</b>

14:39.540 --> 14:43.170
<b>Looks like our intel was right.
He's constantly imbuing himself with magic.</b>

14:43.790 --> 14:45.380
<b>That means my spell should hit him hard!</b>

14:45.830 --> 14:47.960
<b>"Burn bright! Forbidden spell!"</b>

14:48.420 --> 14:49.250
<b>Will o' Wis-</b>

14:53.540 --> 14:56.210
<b>Don't pull any funny tricks, worm.</b>

14:56.210 --> 14:57.170
<b>You again!</b>

14:57.580 --> 14:59.880
<b>So you dodged at the last friggin' second, huh?</b>

15:00.330 --> 15:01.670
<b>But that's not going to save you!</b>

15:08.040 --> 15:11.170
<b>It won't break? What kind of sword is that?</b>

15:11.580 --> 15:14.250
<b>I forged this myself. It's just a regular magic sword.</b>

15:14.880 --> 15:18.920
<b>Guess you're not such hot shit
if you can't even manage to break it!</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:20.880
<b>It's over.</b>

15:21.290 --> 15:24.380
<b>Just go down so that we can appease Lady Freya.</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:26.540
<b>Like hell we will!</b>

15:29.460 --> 15:32.500
<b>Lili. I really think I should go help everybody else...</b>

15:32.500 --> 15:33.210
<b>Absolutely not!</b>

15:33.880 --> 15:35.880
<b>The King is one of the main pillars of their forces!</b>

15:36.210 --> 15:38.790
<b>And your skill is the only shot we have at taking him out!</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:43.040
<b>It has to be a fully-charged hit that he can't see coming!</b>

15:44.420 --> 15:45.130
<b>All right.</b>

15:46.630 --> 15:51.080
<b>But Master Hedin is too sharp to
let anything slip by. Will this really work?</b>

15:54.460 --> 15:55.250
<b>Mr. Van?!</b>

15:58.420 --> 16:02.670
<b>Did you seriously think nobody would notice
you running around making all that noise, Bell?!</b>

16:02.920 --> 16:03.670
<b>Mr. Van...</b>

16:04.790 --> 16:05.750
<b>It's just him?</b>

16:06.330 --> 16:07.420
<b>Where's the rest of his squad?</b>

16:07.420 --> 16:08.630
<b>I'm alone.</b>

16:08.630 --> 16:09.330
<b>Huh?</b>

16:09.710 --> 16:11.460
<b>I didn't come under Master Hedin's orders.</b>

16:11.790 --> 16:14.380
<b>I'm only here because I figured that you'd come this way.</b>

16:14.790 --> 16:16.000
<b>He read me like a book!</b>

16:16.670 --> 16:18.880
<b>I must defeat you with my own hands.</b>

16:19.330 --> 16:22.460
<b>It's my duty. Because I was the one
who took you under my wing!</b>

16:24.960 --> 16:26.080
<b>Bring it on, Bell!</b>

16:26.330 --> 16:27.420
<b>FIGHT ME!</b>

16:30.130 --> 16:31.290
<b>Quit screwing around!</b>

16:33.080 --> 16:34.790
<b>Use that skill you're charging!</b>

16:35.080 --> 16:37.170
<b>You have to beat me or you're not going anywhere!</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:41.500
<b>I'm sorry, Mr. Van.</b>

16:42.170 --> 16:44.630
<b>I remember being terrified of how strong you were.</b>

16:45.460 --> 16:46.330
<b>But now...</b>

16:46.750 --> 16:48.170
<b>you move too slow for me!</b>

16:49.630 --> 16:51.080
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

16:54.920 --> 16:56.710
<b>Bell...</b>

16:59.920 --> 17:01.080
<b>There you are.</b>

17:02.500 --> 17:03.630
<b>Mr. Ottarl!</b>

17:05.040 --> 17:06.880
<b>Took things into your own hands, eh, Van?</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.880
<b>But thankfully, this saves me the trouble of searching.</b>

17:13.420 --> 17:15.330
<b>I'm still a long way from being at full charge.</b>

17:23.460 --> 17:24.540
<b>You get one free hit.</b>

17:24.880 --> 17:25.500
<b>Huh?</b>

17:25.920 --> 17:27.170
<b>Don't hold back.</b>

17:27.710 --> 17:29.580
<b>Come at me with everything you have.</b>

17:30.130 --> 17:31.130
<b>Is this a trap?</b>

17:31.830 --> 17:35.540
<b>No. That would be pointless for
someone of his caliber to do.</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:39.170
<b>He just wants to test me.</b>

17:39.630 --> 17:40.580
<b>Master Bell...</b>

17:41.210 --> 17:45.960
<b>If he actually manages to take down the King here,
our chances at winning will drastically improve!</b>

17:49.960 --> 17:51.170
<b>Fire Bolt.</b>

17:53.710 --> 17:54.830
<b>Just a little longer...</b>

17:55.210 --> 17:58.960
<b>All I can do is hit him hard.
With the strongest move I've got!</b>

18:00.250 --> 18:02.790
<b>"Merciful silver amid golden plains."</b>

18:03.170 --> 18:05.580
<b>"I am the feral fighter ordained to the battlefield."</b>

18:06.040 --> 18:08.920
<b>"Wildly I charge, delivering Her divine will."</b>

18:09.330 --> 18:10.830
<b>Hildis Vini.</b>

18:13.670 --> 18:15.420
<b>Master Finn told me about this.</b>

18:15.750 --> 18:19.920
<b>That golden light is a powerful technique
he once used to defeat a level 7 adventurer!</b>

18:31.420 --> 18:32.500
<b>Fully charged!</b>

18:37.080 --> 18:38.670
<b>ARGO VESTA!</b>

18:46.330 --> 18:47.250
<b>Master Bell!</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:54.380
<b>We were evenly matched.</b>

18:59.580 --> 19:04.170
<b>No. Considering our levels,
I suppose you came out on top.</b>

19:04.460 --> 19:06.170
<b>An impressive attack, indeed.</b>

19:09.920 --> 19:13.710
<b>But from here on out... it's just a regular fight.</b>

19:16.880 --> 19:19.250
<b>I told you before, worm.</b>

19:19.750 --> 19:23.750
<b>You guys are nothing but useless trash
on the battlefield. You're losers.</b>

19:38.420 --> 19:43.630
<b>Blast it to hell. This is why I didn't want to fight you...</b>

19:46.670 --> 19:48.000
<b>Take pride.</b>

19:48.670 --> 19:51.040
<b>You posed a real threat to my life.</b>

19:53.000 --> 19:54.210
<b>Oh no, Cyclops!</b>

19:56.630 --> 19:58.710
<b>A fresh batch of tributes, I see.</b>

20:00.880 --> 20:02.630
<b>Oh shit! He's coming our way!</b>

20:03.710 --> 20:05.250
<b>D-Daphne!</b>

20:07.080 --> 20:08.500
<b>I need a favor, you guys.</b>

20:09.830 --> 20:10.710
<b>Go get beaten.</b>

20:16.960 --> 20:18.040
<b>Appreciate it!</b>

20:18.210 --> 20:19.080
<b>Again?!</b>

20:19.630 --> 20:23.130
<b>Those magic swords are annoying. They're using them
like arrows to attack us while resupplying their allies.</b>

20:23.330 --> 20:25.380
<b>I've never seen tactics like this before.</b>

20:31.920 --> 20:34.250
<b>We'll keep this up until Lady Naza runs out of swords!</b>

20:34.670 --> 20:37.000
<b>Hopefully Bell Cranel can make his move by then!</b>

20:37.000 --> 20:38.330
<b>MASTER BELL!</b>

20:42.290 --> 20:43.420
<b>Please no...</b>

20:47.290 --> 20:48.080
<b>Bell...</b>

20:50.920 --> 20:53.790
<b>Don't you dare break him, Ottarl.</b>

21:02.210 --> 21:03.710
<b>Fire Bolt!</b>

21:17.500 --> 21:20.750
<b>Remember this moment. This is what it's like to taste dirt.</b>

21:24.580 --> 21:26.130
<b>Please stop...</b>

21:35.000 --> 21:38.080
<b>No more! He's had enough!</b>

21:41.330 --> 21:42.210
<b>Bell...</b>

21:44.880 --> 21:46.880
<b>Where do you think you're going, Asfi?</b>

21:47.210 --> 21:48.540
<b>Like you have to ask!</b>

21:49.210 --> 21:51.460
<b>And don't you dare try to tell me it's pointless!</b>

21:58.080 --> 21:59.000
<b>Get up.</b>

21:59.500 --> 22:02.250
<b>If you're going to be the one who basks in her love,</b>

22:03.170 --> 22:04.670
<b>then surpass me.</b>

22:19.130 --> 22:21.750
<b>This secret sinks</b>

22:21.750 --> 22:24.210
<b>Into the undulating water's surface</b>

22:24.630 --> 22:28.790
<b>There was apparently enough room to notice</b>

22:29.580 --> 22:36.290
<b>Though unable to express them clearly, my pure-white feelings</b>

22:36.290 --> 22:39.460
<b>Once again become desires when called out</b>

22:39.460 --> 22:44.460
<b>These eager emotions surge just like waves</b>

22:44.830 --> 22:50.040
<b>Swelling up unknowingly with a gentle tingle</b>

22:51.130 --> 22:57.670
<b>And after the wall dividing us crumbled, the words I understood</b>

22:57.790 --> 23:02.130
<b>Simply float unsteadily in the sky</b>

23:02.630 --> 23:08.170
<b>I want a love that grows bountiful even if it's empty</b>

23:08.420 --> 23:13.750
<b>If this is a dream I might as well take the lies out, too</b>

23:13.750 --> 23:17.420
<b>Even a life that cannot be stolen</b>

23:17.540 --> 23:23.000
<b>Changes the heart by filling it a little</b>

23:23.290 --> 23:28.960
<b>An innocent mist that's like a dizzy spell</b>

23:36.130 --> 23:41.080
<b>Next time</b>

23:36.130 --> 23:41.080
<b>Astrea Record</b>

23:36.130 --> 23:41.080
<b>Inheritance</b>

23:36.830 --> 23:39.380
<b>Next time: "Astrea Record".</b>
